<svg viewBox="0 0 1300 690" width="100%" style="min-width:1000px" role="img" aria-label="Input, volume and mute: each line input feeds one gang of a 100k linear pot (or an X9C104 later) whose wiper has a 10k taper resistor to ground, then 47 uF and 5.6k to the LA4440 input. Mute: toggle SW1 or a GPIO through 2N3904 Q1 and 2N5401 Q2 connects VCC through 1.8k to the LA4440 mute pin, with 47 uF to ground">
